@startuml
!include style.iuml
' Teacher exam wizard (Admin_Web_Panel pages/teacher/CreateExamPage.tsx, routes /teacher/create-exam and
' /teacher/exams/:examId/edit) and ExamsController.CreateExam / UpdateExam / ValidateExamPayloadAsync /
' RefuseOtherTeachersStudentsAsync (own sections or no section, else 403 STUDENT_NOT_IN_YOUR_SECTIONS) / MapQuestions.
' The save stages audit EXAM_CREATED (UpdateExam: EXAM_UPDATED) in the same SaveChanges.
' Simplified labels: routes, status codes and the full validation list are in the chapter text.
' Large font at dpi 96. Printed pt = fontSize * printed_width_pt / png_width_px.
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 28
skinparam ArrowFontSize 27
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #777777
  TitleFontSize 29
}

|Web Panel (Teacher)|
start
:Open the exam
wizard (create
or edit);
:1 Basic info;
:2 Questions: MCQ,
theory, coding
with test cases;
:3 Rules: apps,
lockdown, webcam,
readiness, seat;
:4 Assign
students;
repeat
  :Save the
  exam;
  |Server|
  :Edit only: exam
  exists, own section,
  still Scheduled;
  :Validate section,
  questions, marks
  and test cases;
  :Teacher role: check
  students are in
  own sections;
  |Web Panel (Teacher)|
  backward :Show the
  error, fix
  the step;
  |Server|
repeat while (All checks\npass?) is ([no]) not ([yes])
:Save exam, questions,
students and audit
entry together;
|Web Panel (Teacher)|
:Back to the
dashboard;
stop
@enduml
